SUqEQ7kNvwHwQB4S&_nc_oc=AdrgpoWhXwHI4qzigq7vdAmis9dzBHEPd3Ab6KmqSCr3vn3ygI_9X-Vea-8hTMR4Svc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af3USp9BDh2izZ9lksccnVYltPZ9UK8vPFIQKqxaSH67qg&oe=69F0D14F"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Bold Type VR", "keywords": ["BoldTypeVR", "Word", "Puzzle", "PuzzleVR", "WordPuzzle"], "long_description": "Choose Your Challenge: Tackle puzzles at your own pace with Easy, Medium, and Hard modes.\nCustomizable Themes: Personalize your game with vibrant letter color themes for a visually engaging experience.\nHints to the Rescue: Stuck on a word? The Hint Menu is your secret weapon, showing all the words you need to uncover.\nAchievements & Trophies: Unlock unique trophies as you meet specific achievements and showcase your word-finding mastery!\n\nWhether you\u2019re a casual player looking for relaxing fun or a puzzle enthusiast seeking a challenge, The Bold Type offers endless entertainment and a fresh twist on the classic word search game and an unforgettable experience that challenges your mind while keeping you engaged in a stunning virtual world.\n\nStep into the world of the Bold Type, a cutting-edge VR adventure that redefines the classic word search puzzle! ", "short_description": "Dive into a thrilling puzzle world \nwhere words are hidden all around you\u2014can you find them all?\n\nImmerse yourself in a fully interactive 360\u00b0 puzzle challenge where every turn and corner bring new discoveries. It\u2019s not just a word search\u2014it\u2019s an exploration! With the power of VR, you\u2019re not just solving puzzles\u2014you\u2019re living them!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://distantpoint.org/boldtype/BoldType.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Distant Point", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://distantpoint.org/#home", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_t